#. EN: The exercise
#. EN: Together, agree on a playful rule: in everyday life you may meet each other briefly and deliberately sensually – and stop before it really gets going. At about ninety percent, you smile and the day goes on.
#. EN: An example: in the kitchen in the morning you take your partner in your arms for a slow, intimate kiss, let your hands wander calmly over back and hips and take a few breaths together. After about a minute you let go, smile and leave. No comment about later, no “to be continued”.
