#. EN:
#. EN: Consent and safety
#. EN: Discuss the rule beforehand instead of surprising each other with it. What feels playful to one can feel intrusive to the other – for example when someone is stressed, tired or just not in the mood. Agree on a simple sign with which either of you can say “not today” at any time without having to explain, and accept it without disappointment. Pressure-free works both ways: the game itself must never become an obligation.
