#. Glaubenssatz mit Gegenstück
#. EN: The clitoris is a whole system of erectile tissue that needs time to fill. For many women this takes considerably longer than a few minutes, and the range is wide – from woman to woman and from day to day. The idea that you should be there after a few minutes comes from films rather than real life. Your pace is not a flaw.
